    thinking: "**Constructing The Analyzer**\n\nI\'m now building the `SentenceAnalyzer.tsx` component. My focus is on creating an interactive Japanese morphological and grammar breakdown tool. Users will be able to paste Japanese sentences, or select from presets. It\'s becoming quite intuitive.\n\n\n**Developing Sentence Analyzer**\n\nI\'ve progressed to implementing the sentence analyzer with several key features. I\'m focusing on providing furigana, romaji, and PT-BR translations, as well as grammatical breakdowns, all linked to an API. I\'m also ensuring offline heuristics for consistent operation. I\'m prioritizing an intuitive design for user interaction.\n\n\n"
